  "r:\"^Deal\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+all\\s+foes\\s+equal\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Attack\\.\\s+Decrease\\s+foes'\\s+Defense\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+for\\s+every\\s+(\\d+)\\s+points\\s+of\\s+\\{\\{A\\}\\}'s\\s+Speed\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\)\\.\\s+Also\\s+gain\\s+(\\d+)\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|159\\\"><u>Memory</u></link>\\s+stacks\\s+for\\s+each\\s+foe\\s+attacked\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Draws\\s+on\\s+the\\s+souls\\s+of\\s+the\\s+departed\\s+for\\s+a\\s+single\\s+powerful\\s+strike,\\s+dealing\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+foe\\s+equal\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Attack\\.\\s+If\\s+foe\\s+has\\s+a\\s+debuff,\\s+increase\\s+damage\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\.\\s+When\\s+spending\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|127\\\"><u>(.+)\\s+Soup</u></link>,\\s+inflict\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|108\\\"><u>Forget</u></link>\\s+on\\s+the\\s+main\\s+target\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\.\\nIf\\s+foe\\s+is\\s+inflicted\\s+with\\s+Forget\\s+or\\s+another\\s+spiritual\\s+ailment,\\s+increase\\s+their\\s+damage\\s+taken\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+for\\s+every\\s+(\\d+)\\s+points\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+Speed\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\)\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turn\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>An\\s+aura\\s+of\\s+death\\s+arises\\s+from\\s+where\\s+the\\s+spider\\s+lilies\\s+bloom,\\s+dealing\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+all\\s+foes\\s+equal\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Attack,\\s+and\\s+inflict\\s+Red\\s+Spider\\s+Lily\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\.\\s+When\\s+spending\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|127\\\"><u>(.+)\\s+Soup</u></link>,\\s+double\\s+Red\\s+Spider\\s+Lily's\\s+damage\\s+increase\\.\\nRed\\s+Spider\\s+Lily:\\s+Increase\\s+foes'\\s+damage\\s+taken\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+for\\s+every\\s+(\\d+)\\s+points\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+Speed\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\)\\.\\s+Lasts\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns,\\s+or\\s+until\\s+damage\\s+is\\s+taken\\s+(\\d+)\\s+times\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Summons\\s+a\\s+raging\\s+lion\\s+from\\s+the\\s+afterlife\\s+and\\s+deals\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+all\\s+foes\\s+equal\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Attack,\\s+and\\s+increase\\s+target's\\s+damage\\s+taken\\s+by\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\.\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+chance\\s+to\\s+inflict\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|108\\\"><u>Forget</u></link>\\s+on\\s+foes\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\.\\n1\\s+MORE：Deal\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+foe\\.\\nMelee\\s+Attack：Deal\\s+Physical\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+foe\\.\\nRanged\\s+Attack：Deal\\s+Gun\\s+damage\\s+to\\s+random\\s+foes\\.\\s+Fire\\s+(\\d+)\\s+shots\\s+at\\s+once,\\s+and\\s+can\\s+fire\\s+until\\s+out\\s+of\\s+ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, and increase target's damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\. (.+?)% chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Forget</u></link> on foes for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Curse damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Fire (\\d+) shots at once, and can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
