  "r:\"^When\\s+attacking\\s+a\\s+foe\\s+with\\s+more\\s+than\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+HP,\\s+increase\\s+foe's\\s+Curse\\s+damage\\s+taken\\s+by\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, and increase Firecracker {{A}}'s critical rate by (\\d+)% for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, for (\\d+) turn, <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link> deals more Fire damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\n(.+?)\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, with a (\\d+)% chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Burn</u></link>, and a (\\d+)% chance to inflict (\\d+) Year-End Flames stack for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, for (\\d+) turn, <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link> has a (\\d+)% chance to inflict (\\d+) Year-End Flames stack\\.\\nYear-End Flames: Take Fire damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Firecracker {{A}}'s Attack for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\n(.+?)\"": "",
  "r:\"Gain Flaming Sword Dance: Increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>, and melee attack evolves to Yanhua Slash\\. After activating Yanhua Slash, or at the end of the turn, remove this effect\\.\\nThis skill has a cooldown time of (\\d+) turn, and after using it, other skills can be used on the same turn \\(this skill is not considered a normal skill\\)\\.\\nYanhua Slash: Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, and can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Fire Technicals</u></link>\\. When <link\\=(.+?)><u>Fireburn</u></link> is activated, the damage increase effect becomes (\\d+)%\\.\\n(.+?)\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nIncrease Firecracker {{A}}'s Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>, and damage dealt by <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Fire damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Fire 3 shots at once, and can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase damage to foes inflicted with <link\\=(.+?)><u>Burn</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"At the start of battle, increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. When Firecracker {{A}} or allies activate a Technical, this effect's duration is reset, and the increase effect becomes <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Firecracker {{A}}'s melee attack can evolve to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link>\\. When evolved, deal heavy Fire damage to targets, and can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Fire Technical</u></link>\\. Also, when <link\\=(.+?)><u>Fireburn</u></link> is activated, the damage increase effect becomes (\\d+)%\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Reduce the first cooldown time for Orange Blossom Blade by (\\d+) turn\\. Also, extend the duration of <link\\=(.+?)><u>Flaming Sword Dance</u></link> by (\\d+) turn, and <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link> can be activated up to (\\d+) times\\. Also, when Flaming Sword Dance is active, enhance Scarlet Surprise and Firework Finale\\.\\nScarlet Surprise: When enhanced, increase the critical damage of Yanhua Slash by (\\d+)% more\\.\\nFirework Finale: When enhanced, Yanhua Slash inflicts (\\d+) more <link\\=(.+?)><u>Year-End Flames</u></link> stack\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When Firecracker {{A}} is present, for each foe that appears, permanently inflict (\\d+) special limit-breaking <link\\=(.+?)><u>Burn</u></link> stack\\. When this Burn is removed, (\\d+) more stack is immediately inflicted\\. This effect's cooldown time is (\\d+) turns, calculated individually for each foe\\.\\nDuring battle, when (\\d+) foe is inflicted with Burn, increase Firecracker {{A}}'s critical rate by (\\d+)%\\. Also, for each additional foe inflicted with Burn, increase by (\\d+)% more \\(up to a maximum of (\\d+)%\\)\\.\"": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Firework Finale and Orange Blossom Blade by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase Firecracker {{A}}'s critical damage by 15% more for 2 turns. Also, extend the duration of all buffs gained from this Highlight by 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Scarlet Surprise and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "r:\"<link\\=(.+?)><u>Flaming Sword Dance</u></link> becomes permanent\\. <link\\=(.+?)><u>Yanhua Slash</u></link> evolves to Liuxing Slash, increasing damage dealt by (\\d+)%\\. Flaming Sword Dance is not removed even after Liuxing Slash is activated\\.\\nAlso, Scarlet Surprise permanently maintains the critical rate increase and enhanced effects on Liuxing Slash\\. The duration of Firework Finale's <link\\=(.+?)><u>Burn</u></link> and enhanced effects on Liuxing Slash are extended by (\\d+) turn\\.\"": "",
  "On Yaoling's action, gain 1 Memory stack for every 10 points of Speed (up to 18 stacks per turn). When Memory reaches 40 stacks, spend all stacks to gain 1 <link\\=\"s|127\"><u>Meng Po Soup</u></link> stack.\\nWhen using a skill, spend 1 <link\\=\"s|127\"><u>Meng Po Soup</u></link> stack for a 50% chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|108\"><u>Forget</u></link> on 1 foe for 1 turn, and enhance effects of Flowers of Naihe and Lion Dance of Oblivion.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|127\"><u>Meng Po Soup</u></link> stack.": "",
  "Increase Attack by 10% for each debuff inflicted on foes for 2 turns. Stacks up to 5 times.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Lion Dance of Oblivion and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase damage taken effect by 20%. Inflict <link\\=\"s|112\"><u>Curse</u></link> on all foes for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Underworld Ferry and Flowers of Naihe by 3.": "",
