  "r:\"Fire dmg to all foes \\(([\\d.]+)% Atk\\), and increase crit rate (\\d+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\).\\nAlso, for (\\d+) turn, Yanhua Slash deals more Fire dmg \\(([\\d.]+)% Atk\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Fire dmg to all foes \\(([\\d.]+)% Atk\\), (\\d+)% chance to inflict Burn, and (\\d+)% chance to inflict (\\d+) Year-End Flames \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nFor (\\d+) turn, Yanhua Slash has (\\d+)% chance to inflict (\\d+) Year-End Flames\\.\\nYear-End Flames: Take Fire dmg \\(([\\d.]+)% of Firecracker {{A}}'s Atk, (\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Gain Flaming Sword Dance \\((\\d+) turn\\): Increase dmg ([\\d.]+)%, evolve melee attack to Yanhua Slash\\. Remove after activating Yanhua Slash or at end of turn\\. Has (\\d+)-turn cooldown, and other skills can be used on same turn after use \\(this skill isn't considered a normal skill\\)\\.\\nYanhua Slash: Fire dmg to all foes \\(([\\d.]+)% Atk\\), can activate Fire Technicals\\. When Fireburn is activated, dmg increase becomes (\\d+)%\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Fire dmg to all foes \\(([\\d.]+)% Atk\\)\\.\\nIncrease Firecracker {{A}}'s Atk ([\\d.]+)%, and Yanhua Slash dmg ([\\d.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\"": ""
